{"unit_id":"DSH-USER-GTB__dsh-answer-top#feature-1","repo":"DSH-USER-GTB/dsh-answer-top","commit":"80e73ae20fd43e8738428ef07e94526d5841a824","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-answer-top 的功能「回答结束后回到开头」：检测本轮回答结束后，将较长回答平滑滚动到第一条回答内容附近；短内容不触发滚动，近期用户操作会让自动滚动跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:839-937","lib/client.js:743-747"]}
